Then what are they?

261
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:55,017
What happened to the screen?

262
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:57,041
Hey, what happened to the screen?

263
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:10,117
Struggle all you want, White Beard.

264
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,977
We still have the upper hand.

265
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:13,680
Ready to crush you!

266
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:17,877
As soon as every video feed has been cut,

267
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:24,277
activate the encircling walls and once
that's set, we will Immediately execute Ace.

268
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:26,831
and round up all of our remaining enemies.

269
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,060
Yes, sir!

270
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:35,000
Move it!

271
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:46,040
They're about to kill
Ace! I'd better hurry!

272
00:21:49,620 --> 00:21:51,960
Sorry, back to square one.

273
00:21:53,540 --> 00:21:54,680
Luffy, no!

274
00:22:04,260 --> 00:22:05,460
Team Bay!

275
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:13,477
The Admiral's getting in on the fight!

276
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:14,480
Damn it!

277
00:22:15,600 --> 00:22:17,740
Yet we must press on regardless.

278
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:21,697
We knew we would face insurmountable
odds and undefeatable foes.

279
00:22:21,780 --> 00:22:26,074
Them sending out their best only means
we're too close for their comfort.

280
00:22:28,260 --> 00:22:31,080
Time to die, son of dragon.

281
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:42,140
Hey, Ace's brother, you're not
running out of steam, are you?

282
00:22:47,340 --> 00:22:51,660
White Beard's commanders, we won't
find any better backup than that.

283
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:56,200
You can't let one man halt
your advance now follow us

284
00:22:56,840 --> 00:23:00,300
Yeah, let's take them
the name is pulling back.

285
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,537
So now's our chance.

286
00:23:01,620 --> 00:23:03,796
We're breaking through these bastards

287
00:23:05,660 --> 00:23:06,817
Lock here.

288
00:23:06,900 --> 00:23:08,460
It's a real fight

289
00:23:19,460 --> 00:23:22,417
Well if it isn't 10th
Division Commander Carol

290
00:23:22,500 --> 00:23:25,677
look at that angry glower
do you really want to die?

291
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:32,237
With such a sour face you do realize you'll
be buried in this bay if you stay here

292
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:38,317
first taste Will die and then your cronies
will be trapped and wiped out i honestly

293
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:40,237
couldn't care less about Who's gonna win

294
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:43,837
this war but watching
White Beard die that's

295
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:48,497
fun pops and ace won't
die not while I'm around

296
00:23:48,580 --> 00:23:55,580
shall

297
00:23:58,380 --> 00:23:59,210
we put

298
00:23:59,293 --> 00:24:00,123
this match on hold?

299
00:24:00,206 --> 00:24:01,036
Vista

300
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:05,880
Much as I hate to we do have
other matters to worry about

301
00:24:12,460 --> 00:24:17,160
We've got to back down So let's go
Smoker Didn't you hear the orders?

302
00:24:19,540 --> 00:24:20,370
Yeah.

303
00:24:21,540 --> 00:24:22,820
I heard them.

304
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:26,280
Next time, Straw Hat.

305
00:24:33,840 --> 00:24:36,160
Luffy, you can do it. Stay strong.

306
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:44,737
Where the hell hasn't
the video feed been cut?

307
00:24:44,820 --> 00:24:45,650
Sorry, sir.

308
00:24:45,760 --> 00:24:47,466
It'll just be another minute.

309
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:50,160
We're all set.

310
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,915
Hey, Gaffer, you're blocking the shot.

311
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:56,647
It seems like they've cut all
the camera feeds except for one.

312
00:24:56,780 --> 00:24:58,237
What's going on down there?

313
00:24:58,320 --> 00:24:59,237
What is this feed?

314
00:24:59,320 --> 00:25:02,060
Wait, is that who I think it is?

315
00:25:02,580 --> 00:25:04,220
Oh, it is!

316
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,980
I can't believe it's him!

317
00:25:06,340 --> 00:25:09,057
He's been laying low for
all these years, but...

318
00:25:09,140 --> 00:25:13,057
He was a member of the legendary
crew that served under Gold Roger,

319
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:14,552
the king of the pirates!

320
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:15,890
Huh?

321
00:25:16,040 --> 00:25:16,960
Who is it?

322
00:25:17,180 --> 00:25:21,360
Can it really be the renowned
pirate Captain Buggy? Huh?

323
00:25:23,020 --> 00:25:26,420
I'm sorry, did someone say my name? Huh?

324
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:32,960
It is classified
information, but I admit it.

325
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:35,520
I am the legendary pirate.

326
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:38,560
Hey, hold it, Captain Page. Stop.

327
00:25:38,900 --> 00:25:40,560
You've got a nose blade.

328
00:25:45,700 --> 00:25:47,357
Come out, sir, man.

329
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,560
Thank you, dammit.

330
00:25:49,760 --> 00:25:51,477
What the hell is happening here?

331
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:55,580
How many times have I ordered you
fools to cap the stupid video?

332
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:58,240
We can't move with the world watching.

333
00:25:59,000 --> 00:25:59,830
I understand,

334
00:25:59,913 --> 00:26:00,743
sir,

335
00:26:00,826 --> 00:26:02,337
but I'm afraid that the
escaped prisoners have somehow

336
00:26:02,420 --> 00:26:06,008
managed to steal one of the
video transponder snails from us.

337
00:26:06,540 --> 00:26:07,370
What?

338
00:26:07,453 --> 00:26:08,687
How did you let this happen?

339
00:26:10,060 --> 00:26:10,890
Makeup.

340
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:12,180
Ready to roll.

341
00:26:12,420 --> 00:26:14,000
All right, guys, mark it.

342
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:18,400
Take two in three, two, one, and...

343
00:26:19,040 --> 00:26:21,260
Oh, is that who I think it is?

344
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:24,197
The legendary crew member
of Gold Roger and the

345
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:26,957
sworn brother of Shanks
of the Four Emperors?

346
00:26:27,040 --> 00:26:31,020
Could it really be the
mythical pirate, Captain Buggy?

347
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:33,720
Did someone say my name?

348
00:26:34,060 --> 00:26:36,200
Stop those idiots right this second!

349
00:26:39,460 --> 00:26:40,900
Oh, that was close!

350
00:26:41,260 --> 00:26:43,240
They found us one for it!

351
00:26:45,020 --> 00:26:48,857
I just saw you get sliced in half
by the infamous Hawkeye Mihawk,

352
00:26:48,940 --> 00:26:51,175
but there's not even a scratch on you!

353
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:52,910
Oh, me?

354
00:26:54,500 --> 00:26:56,780
That's right, I'm Buggy!

355
00:26:57,040 --> 00:27:00,060
The living legend! Throw them away!

356
00:27:00,260 --> 00:27:01,600
I want them dead!

357
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,140
Cut back to the war, dammit!

358
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:06,897
Why are we getting video of this moron?

359
00:27:06,980 --> 00:27:07,940
Go back to Ace!

360
00:27:08,100 --> 00:27:09,757
We're gonna miss the execution!

361
00:27:09,840 --> 00:27:12,740
I wanna see that army
of Bartholomew Kumars!

362
00:27:17,860 --> 00:27:19,060
Stand tall, men!

363
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,080
We can't stop now!

364
00:27:21,580 --> 00:27:24,300
Not until we know that
Ace is safe! Let's go!

365
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,660
Hey, Pops.

366
00:27:50,980 --> 00:27:52,200
Oh, Squad.

367
00:27:52,660 --> 00:27:54,131
Good to see you're alive.

368
00:27:54,540 --> 00:27:55,800
Yeah, barely.

369
00:27:56,580 --> 00:27:57,410
Is that so?

370
00:27:57,500 --> 00:27:59,500
I was trying to reach you earlier.

371
00:27:59,940 --> 00:28:02,177
How are things looking
at the bay head now?

372
00:28:02,260 --> 00:28:05,820
I'm sorry to say, but your
allies were beaten pretty badly.

373
00:28:06,520 --> 00:28:10,877
Little does he know it works in our favor
for them to attack us from the rear.

374
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,440
I'm joining the fight.

375
00:28:12,660 --> 00:28:15,189
Our only chance is to
keep pushing forward.

376
00:28:15,480 --> 00:28:16,900
I couldn't agree more.

377
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:21,540
What's Squared doing up there?

378
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:25,540
You have 43 allied captains
willing to die for you.

379
00:28:25,800 --> 00:28:29,480
We're all in your debt,
for now and for always.

380
00:28:29,980 --> 00:28:33,921
We consider it a privilege to risk
our lives for you and your crew.

381
00:28:56,460 --> 00:28:59,640
I don't know.
